  "prefLabel": "Liq 705.35 Beer Festival License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 705.35 Beer Festival License. Applicants for a beer festival license shall complete and submit Form LTW-14, “License Type Worksheet-Beer Festival” (revised 8/2020) providing all required information, acknowledgments, and attach the following:\n\n(a) Proof of non-profit status from the New Hampshire Secretary of State; and\n\n(b) A letter of designation from a non-profit group.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html"
